<title>GERMANY: ATC Aviation Services opens Munich airport office.</title>
<headline>ATC Aviation Services opens Munich airport office.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo sales agent company ATC Aviation Services AG said it has opened an office at Munich Airport.</p>
<p>Andreas Wald has been appointed Munich office manager, an ATC statement said.</p>
<p>Airlines represented by ATC as general sales agent include Air Mauritius and Air Alfa, which both fly to Munich, Royal Brunei Airlines, Royal Air Maroc and Zimbabwe's cargo airline Affretair.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+44 171 542-5017</p>
